      "body": "I suppose we should not log LocalizedException. LocalizedException intended for showing to user, not for logging.\r\nYou should intercept real transport exception and log it. I suggest to do it here\r\n\\Magento\\Framework\\Mail\\Transport::sendMessage\r\n\\Magento\\Email\\Model\\Transport::sendMessage\r\n in catch section where actually MailException created\r\n\r\nI'd also changed implementation and dont show real transport exception to user as it done \r\n```\r\nthrow new MailException(new Phrase($e->getMessage()), $e);\r\n```\r\nIt can be potentially security issue. But create something like:\r\n```\r\nthrow new MailException(new Phrase('Mail transport failure'), $e); // don't forget add translation\r\n```\r\n",
